<title>SINGAPORE: Goldtron first half net down 45 pct.</title>
<headline>Goldtron first half net down 45 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months till June 30 1996</p>
<p>( in million of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  7.44  vs  13.43</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)    2.00  vs   4.10</p>
<p>    Turnover		  299.65  vs 265.38</p>
<p>    Operating profit	  6.31  vs  14.69</p>
<p>    Associates		  4.11  vs   2.92</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    10.42  vs  18.09</p>
<p>    Tax			   2.26  vs   3.36</p>
<p>    Minorities		 (0.71) vs  (1.31)</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	  (2.57) vs  (0.50)</p>
<p>Note - Electronics firm Goldtron Ltd said it viewed the results for the rest of the year with cautious optimism amid the current weakness of the industry.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
